/*
  Localizable.strings (Russian) — default user-facing strings of TesseraStartScreen.

  The default strings live in SPM resources rather than in Swift literals.
  The keys match en.lproj/Localizable.strings one to one (parity is checked by
  Tests/TesseraStartScreenTests/LocalizationTests.swift). Do not rename a key
  without updating TesseraStartScreenStrings.Key and the parity tests.

  Placeholders: %1$@ is a string, %1$ld is an integer.
*/

/* MARK: - Editing mode (VoiceOver) */

